{
  "id": "morpho/vault-v2-cap-submit",
  "card": {
    "vault": {
      "kind": "contract",
      "registryKind": "vault",
      "defillama": "morpho-blue"
    },
    "market": {
      "kind": "market"
    },
    "absolute-cap": {
      "kind": "amount",
      "of": "vault.asset",
      "max": {
        "value": "340282366920938463463374607431768211455",
        "why": {
          "en": "Vault V2 stores an absolute cap in 128 bits (increaseAbsoluteCap, newAbsoluteCap.toUint128()), so 2^128-1 is the largest cap it holds; curators set it for a market they cap only by its relative cap, as most submissions of the last year did.",
          "zh-TW": "Vault V2 用 128 bits 存絕對上限（increaseAbsoluteCap，newAbsoluteCap.toUint128()），所以 2^128-1 是它能存的最大上限；curator 只想用相對上限限制某個市場時就設這個值，過去一年大多數的提交都是這樣。"
        }
      }
    },
    "relative-cap": {
      "kind": "percent"
    }
  },
  "same": [
    "vault.asset",
    "market.loanToken"
  ],
  "calls": [
    {
      "to": {
        "card": "vault"
      },
      "value": {
        "const": "0"
      },
      "function": "multicall(bytes[] data)",
      "args": {
        "data": {
          "items": [
            {
              "call": {
                "function": "submit(bytes data)",
                "args": {
                  "data": {
                    "call": {
                      "function": "increaseAbsoluteCap(bytes idData, uint256 newAbsoluteCap)",
                      "args": {
                        "idData": {
                          "encoded": {
                            "as": "capId(string kind, address adapter, (address loanToken, address collateralToken, address oracle, address irm, uint256 lltv) marketParams)",
